# Dose of Dawnglow: "Then if it isn't your main phase, blight 2" (CR 505.1, 701.68a) asks for a main phase of the caster's own
# turn, not merely the caster's turn: cast in Bot1's own end step on turn 3 it returns the Shimmercreep (Bolted twice on turn 2,
# its drain running again: Bot2 18, Bot1 22) and then blights 2 on it, its only creature, which becomes a 1/3. The twin cast in
# Bot1's main phase is "...-in-your-main-phase-only-returns-the-creature".

